        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "RYFT holt auf. Versuch es gleich noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RYFT needs Apple Health access, and your watch app writing to Apple Health (Garmin Connect → More → Settings → Apple Health). Check RYFT's access in Health → your profile → Apps → RYFT." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the user's health access.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "RYFT braucht Zugriff auf Apple Health, und deine Uhren-App muss in Apple Health schreiben (Garmin Connect → Mehr → Einstellungen → Apple Health). Prüfe den Zugriff von RYFT unter Health → dein Profil → Apps → RYFT."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RYFT turns what your watch writes to Apple Health into recovery, strain and sleep scores." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the purpose of the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
